SmtLib_Logics.sml       SMT-LIB 2 logics.
SmtLib_Parser.sml       Parsing of SMT-LIB 2 benchmarks.
SmtLib_Theories.sml     SMT-LIB 2 theories.
SmtLib.sml              Translation of HOL terms into SMT-LIB 2 format.
SmtBagProve.{sig,sml}   Checked proofs for SMT-LIB Bag operations.
SmtSeqProve.{sig,sml}   Checked proofs for SMT-LIB sequence operations.
SmtResource.sml         Fixed checked-replay resource budget and diagnostics.
